{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":37.880001068115234,"text":"A naked young man with a beard, 2.04 meters tall, stands leaning on a long spear, the way heroes stood in the statues of the sculptor Lysippos. He is bronze and was found in 1885 next to the boxer, buried with him. His eyes were inlaid in another material and are lost, which is why he looks at you with empty sockets. Nobody knows who he is. He used to be called the Hellenistic prince, a king from the East. Today, most scholars think he is a Roman general of the 2nd century BC, perhaps Scipio Aemilianus, because he was found near the place where Scipio had his villa.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.41999998688697815},{"word":"naked","start":0.41999998688697815,"end":0.7799999713897705},{"word":"young","start":0.7799999713897705,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"man","start":1.100000023841858,"end":1.399999976158142},{"word":"with","start":1.399999976158142,"end":1.659999966621399},{"word":"a","start":1.659999966621399,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"beard","start":2.119999885559082,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"2","start":2.759999990463257,"end":2.799999952316284},{"word":"04","start":2.799999952316284,"end":3.5799999237060547},{"word":"meters","start":3.5799999237060547,"end":3.9000000953674316},{"word":"tall","start":3.9000000953674316,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"stands","start":5.019999980926514,"end":5.099999904632568},{"word":"leaning","start":5.099999904632568,"end":5.440000057220459},{"word":"on","start":5.440000057220459,"end":5.679999828338623},{"word":"a","start":5.679999828338623,"end":5.840000152587891},{"word":"long","start":5.840000152587891,"end":6.139999866485596},{"word":"spear","start":6.139999866485596,"end":6.400000095367432},{"word":"the","start":6.940000057220459,"end":7},{"word":"way","start":7,"end":7.179999828338623},{"word":"heroes","start":7.179999828338623,"end":7.639999866485596},{"word":"stood","start":7.639999866485596,"end":7.90000009536